    "Read receipts are exchanged only when both people enable them. Turning this off stops new read receipts; previously confirmed receipts remain.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Read receipts are exchanged only when both people enable them. Turning this off stops new read receipts; previously confirmed receipts remain."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双方开启后才交换已读回执。关闭后停止新的已读回执，已确认的历史状态保留。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "雙方開啟後才交換已讀回條。關閉後停止新的已讀回條，已確認的歷史狀態保留。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "双方が有効にすると既読を通知します。無効にすると新しい既読通知を停止し、確認済みの履歴は保持します。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "양쪽 모두 켜야 읽음 확인을 주고받습니다. 끄면 새로운 읽음 확인을 중지하며 이미 확인된 기록은 유지됩니다。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
